[{"id":"1126564005424840710","date":1557428764000,"rawContent":"Hi! I am Dr. Janis Orlowski, Chief Health Care Officer at the @AAMCtoday #medpagelive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126564343720677376","date":1557428844000,"rawContent":"A1: Sexual harassment consists of 3 distinct behaviors, none of which have any place in medical schools, teaching hospitals, or in the biomedical research setting: #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126564532728606727","date":1557428889000,"rawContent":"1) gender harassment (sexist hostility\/crude behavior), 2) unwanted sexual attention (unwelcome verbal\/physical advances) &amp; 3) sexual coercion (when favorable treatment is conditioned on sexual activity) #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126565577189933057","date":1557429138000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday A1: In 2018 survey of medical students, ~35% of respondents to the AAMC\u2019s Graduate Medical Student Questionnaire experienced a behavior at least once that could be categorized as sexual\/gender harassment. #medpagelive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126566305329483777","date":1557429312000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday also covered this topic in AAMCNews.  https:\/\/t.co\/4tDtBB7yAG #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126566857853550595","date":1557429444000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday A2: As with many industries that use apprenticeship training models, there can be a power discrepancy that leaves students vulnerable to higher rates of sexual &amp; gender harassment #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126566971422720000","date":1557429471000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday There must be multiple ways to report incidences. It\u2019s the institution\u2019s responsibility to have multiple mechanisms to shield the victim #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126567081997152257","date":1557429497000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday We know that more work needs to be done to improve the academic medicine learning environment to create a culture where individuals feel comfortable reporting incidences of sexual harassment #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126567168152358914","date":1557429518000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday Bystander training, harassment training for educators and learners, and regular dialogue are a must if we are to eradicate this from our institutions #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126569722093371392","date":1557430127000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday A3: To address this issue in science and medicine, @AAMCtoday co-founded the Societies Consortium on Sexual Harassment in STEMM  in Feb 2019 w\/ @AAAS, @theAGU &amp; several other orgs #MedPageLive #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/67s6VfvEUw","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126570780228190209","date":1557430379000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday @aaas @theAGU What is being done? The Societies Consortium's goal is to develop strategies to improve professional &amp; ethical conduct, climate, and culture across academia #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126570969479430148","date":1557430424000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday @aaas @theAGU It will provide impactful resources and guidance to address sexual harassment in the member societies\u2019 own operations and more broadly within the fields they represent #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126571069761040386","date":1557430448000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday @aaas @theAGU It will develop research- &amp; evidence-based resources for societies that include findings and expertise from social &amp;   behavioral sciences #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126571159322005505","date":1557430469000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday @aaas @theAGU Initial work has focused on preparing a model policy\/procedure for societies\u2019 honors &amp; awards programs and how to adjust the selection process to address nominees who are alleged perpetrators #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126571410795716609","date":1557430529000,"rawContent":"@medpagetoday @AAMCtoday @aaas @theAGU Going forward, The Societies Consortium has put together a projects list and additional information &amp; resources will be available in the coming months #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126574762950631427","date":1557431328000,"rawContent":"@BarbaraMcAneny @aamctoday agrees! Research confirms sexual harassment is more likely to occur when women leaders are in short supply. That\u2019s certainly the case in academic medicine where there\u2019s a gender gap in leadership #MedPageLive #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/PmhocuFhUp","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126574913496784897","date":1557431364000,"rawContent":"@BarbaraMcAneny @AAMCtoday @AAMCtoday data show that women make up: 18% of department chairs\u2026 https:\/\/t.co\/93iZJFbeRo #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126575081382137858","date":1557431404000,"rawContent":"@BarbaraMcAneny @AAMCtoday And 18% of medical school deans\u2026 https:\/\/t.co\/XBsnj1w3vH #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":18.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126575364862545921","date":1557431472000,"rawContent":"@BarbaraMcAneny @AAMCtoday We are committed to bridging the gender gap in leadership. One way we are doing that is by engaging in research to grasp the current state of med school faculty salaries by gender #MedPageLive #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/a17WWjWtUa","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":19.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126575597424132097","date":1557431527000,"rawContent":"@BarbaraMcAneny @AAMCtoday We\u2019re working to identify promising practices w\/in the community to conduct &amp; advance salary equity studies at the local level #MedPageLive #MeToo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126576672814321670","date":1557431784000,"rawContent":"Combating sexual harassment in academic medicine and across the STEMM fields requires a multi-pronged, ongoing, and sustained approach.  #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126576858714210305","date":1557431828000,"rawContent":"@AAMCtoday is actively working with our member medical schools and teaching hospitals to foster a more diverse, inclusive, and respectful culture across the academic medicine and biomedical research communities. #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":22,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":22.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126577040449253376","date":1557431871000,"rawContent":"@aamctoday launched a series of initiatives designed to curb sexual harassment in medicine, including a set of \u201cFoundational Principles of Inclusion Excellence\u201d to help member medical schools assess the institutional culture and climate. #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126577233630584832","date":1557431917000,"rawContent":"@AAMCToday is hosting a leadership forum in June 2019 focused on gender and sexual harassment, which will bring together leaders from across the academic medicine community to discuss strategies and approaches to address this critical issue. #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126578603335012352","date":1557432244000,"rawContent":"Thanks @medpagetoday for inviting me to participate in this important conversation.  We are committed to working to improve the culture in healthcare and education. #medpagelive #metoo","userId":770361289403142144,"media":null,"username":"JanisOrlowskiMD","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":25,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]